# Unreferenced local files. Kept on disk, kept out of the repo — an old
# working copy and a handful of images nothing on the site links to. The
# stray "old-index" file uses a private-use codepoint where a colon would be,
# so it is matched by wildcard rather than by name.
# Leading slashes matter here: a bare `cosmos.png` would also have excluded
# assets/chains/cosmos.png, which the Cosmos tab needs.
/Everything Raj.png
/C*UsersmedniDesktopold-index.html
